1
00:01:44,260 --> 00:01:45,439
I admire the way you

2
00:01:45,439 --> 00:01:46,640
stood by each other today.

3
00:01:47,040 --> 00:01:47,579
That's exactly

4
00:01:47,579 --> 00:01:48,700
how soldiers of the Yu Army

5
00:01:48,840 --> 00:01:49,760
should be.

6
00:01:50,439 --> 00:01:51,200
These new uniforms

7
00:01:51,700 --> 00:01:52,659
are your reward.

8
00:01:53,700 --> 00:01:54,540
Go put them on.

9
00:02:11,120 --> 00:02:11,560
Here,

10
00:02:11,599 --> 00:02:12,340
raise your rifle.

11
00:02:18,659 --> 00:02:19,639
Pick up the pace.

12
00:02:19,740 --> 00:02:20,639
The front's waiting

13
00:02:20,639 --> 00:02:21,539
on this batch of guns.

14
00:02:21,740 --> 00:02:22,340
Yes.

15
00:02:36,060 --> 00:02:36,780
Kill!

16
00:02:38,879 --> 00:02:39,560
Kill!

17
00:02:39,960 --> 00:02:40,759
Kill!

18
00:02:42,580 --> 00:02:43,139
Two!

19
00:02:44,680 --> 00:02:45,319
Three!

20
00:02:45,699 --> 00:02:46,340
Move it.

21
00:02:46,900 --> 00:02:47,439
Four!

22
00:02:49,080 --> 00:02:49,759
Five!

23
00:02:50,159 --> 00:02:50,960
Kill!

24
00:02:51,039 --> 00:02:51,840
Six!

25
00:02:52,539 --> 00:02:53,280
Salute!

26
00:02:55,780 --> 00:02:56,240
Order arms!

27
00:02:56,599 --> 00:02:57,340
Carry on with training.

28
00:02:57,539 --> 00:02:58,159
Yes, sir.

29
00:02:58,460 --> 00:02:59,259
Changxuan,

30
00:02:59,639 --> 00:03:00,939
you had Zhao Chenghai shot

31
00:03:00,939 --> 00:03:02,039
and rewarded those four soldiers.

32
00:03:02,039 --> 00:03:02,400
One.

33
00:03:02,439 --> 00:03:03,659
The whole mood in the ranks

34
00:03:04,300 --> 00:03:05,319
turned around overnight.

35
00:03:05,539 --> 00:03:06,080
Look,

36
00:03:06,300 --> 00:03:07,419
now there's a spark in

37
00:03:07,479 --> 00:03:08,360
those men's eyes.

38
00:03:09,460 --> 00:03:10,960
I've just taken over as commander,

39
00:03:11,000 --> 00:03:11,939
and morale is shaky.

40
00:03:12,300 --> 00:03:13,300
I can't get thousands of men

41
00:03:13,300 --> 00:03:15,039
obeying me overnight just by

42
00:03:15,699 --> 00:03:17,639
executing people to show my authority.

43
00:03:18,659 --> 00:03:20,199
I need to give them hope.

44
00:03:21,759 --> 00:03:23,240
I want an army

45
00:03:23,240 --> 00:03:24,939
that follows every order.

46
00:03:25,699 --> 00:03:27,120
Holding up those four

47
00:03:27,800 --> 00:03:29,539
as examples rallies the whole army

48
00:03:30,139 --> 00:03:31,400
and sends a message

49
00:03:31,840 --> 00:03:33,960
that anyone with ability and the guts

50
00:03:34,400 --> 00:03:36,639
to risk his life can rise under me.

51
00:03:37,259 --> 00:03:37,979
Kill!

52
00:03:38,699 --> 00:03:39,460
Five!

53
00:03:39,639 --> 00:03:40,300
Kill!

54
00:03:41,860 --> 00:03:42,340
Six.

55
00:03:42,340 --> 00:03:42,860
Kill!

56
00:03:44,520 --> 00:03:45,080
Kill!

57
00:03:45,639 --> 00:03:46,199
Seven.

58
00:03:46,819 --> 00:03:47,219
Kill!

59
00:04:19,699 --> 00:04:20,439
Xueting,

60
00:04:20,800 --> 00:04:21,839
you're finally home.

61
00:04:23,839 --> 00:04:25,220
Good heavens, how did you

62
00:04:26,519 --> 00:04:27,259
end up like this?

63
00:04:39,199 --> 00:04:40,000
Aunt,

64
00:04:41,740 --> 00:04:42,639
I'm sorry.

65
00:04:44,439 --> 00:04:45,759
I shouldn't have made you worry.

66
00:04:48,779 --> 00:04:49,339
Mom.

67
00:04:49,860 --> 00:04:50,660
Get up.

68
00:04:51,139 --> 00:04:52,040
Come on.

69
00:04:52,839 --> 00:04:53,860
Come and sit down.

70
00:05:10,100 --> 00:05:11,339
Thank goodness.

71
00:05:11,699 --> 00:05:12,500
Thank God.

72
00:05:16,040 --> 00:05:16,839
Xueting,

73
00:05:17,639 --> 00:05:19,259
if your mother were still alive,

74
00:05:20,040 --> 00:05:21,459
she'd never have let you do

75
00:05:21,500 --> 00:05:23,160
anything so dangerous.

76
00:05:26,540 --> 00:05:27,339
Dear,

77
00:05:28,339 --> 00:05:29,639
promise me

78
00:05:30,899 --> 00:05:32,699
you'll always think twice

79
00:05:33,639 --> 00:05:35,139
before you act.

80
00:05:35,439 --> 00:05:36,259
Will you?

81
00:05:40,959 --> 00:05:41,759
I will.

82
00:05:44,399 --> 00:05:45,240
I'm just glad you're back.

83
00:05:45,839 --> 00:05:47,060
God bless.

84
00:05:47,139 --> 00:05:48,459
You're home safe now.

85
00:05:57,740 --> 00:05:58,540
Xueting,

86
00:05:58,899 --> 00:06:00,759
you're not dressed warmly enough.

87
00:06:01,420 --> 00:06:02,740
It was sunny a few days ago,

88
00:06:02,920 --> 00:06:03,899
so I aired out

89
00:06:03,899 --> 00:06:05,139
all your winter clothes.

90
00:06:05,360 --> 00:06:05,839
Here.

91
00:06:05,980 --> 00:06:07,100
Let me get a few out.

92
00:06:07,139 --> 00:06:08,120
Pick one and change.

93
00:06:12,800 --> 00:06:13,860
Don't you have anything

94
00:06:13,860 --> 00:06:14,939
to tell me?

95
00:06:36,439 --> 00:06:37,439
What do you mean?

96
00:06:38,839 --> 00:06:39,980
Why did they

97
00:06:41,079 --> 00:06:42,560
cut my sentence to a month?

98
00:06:47,600 --> 00:06:48,759
Was it Yu Changxuan?

99
00:06:56,660 --> 00:06:58,600
He threatened to kill me

100
00:06:59,860 --> 00:07:01,540
unless you agreed to be with him,

101
00:07:02,560 --> 00:07:03,360
right?

102
00:07:22,240 --> 00:07:22,959
Yes.

103
00:07:23,379 --> 00:07:24,100
Why?

104
00:07:25,000 --> 00:07:25,480
Ye Pingjun,

105
00:07:25,480 --> 00:07:26,800
why did you agree?

106
00:07:27,259 --> 00:07:28,300
You knew I'd rather die

107
00:07:28,439 --> 00:07:29,379
than have you

108
00:07:29,459 --> 00:07:30,939
sacrifice yourself for me.

109
00:07:31,160 --> 00:07:31,860
Why?

110
00:07:31,939 --> 00:07:33,160
What else could I do?

111
00:07:33,939 --> 00:07:35,139
Stand by and watch them

112
00:07:35,139 --> 00:07:36,339
shoot you?

113
00:07:37,040 --> 00:07:38,100
What choice

114
00:07:38,100 --> 00:07:39,160
did I have?

115
00:07:52,639 --> 00:07:54,360
I write articles day after day,

116
00:07:54,939 --> 00:07:56,959
thinking I can save people from suffering.

117
00:07:58,860 --> 00:07:59,800
But I can't

118
00:08:00,199 --> 00:08:01,240
even save the woman

119
00:08:01,240 --> 00:08:02,199
I love.

120
00:08:03,779 --> 00:08:04,699
I'm

121
00:08:05,300 --> 00:08:07,139
a complete

122
00:08:09,339 --> 00:08:10,819
failure.

123
00:08:11,740 --> 00:08:12,439
Xueting!

124
00:08:12,449 --> 00:08:13,040
Xueting!

125
00:08:13,060 --> 00:08:13,560
Xueting!

126
00:08:13,560 --> 00:08:14,660
Don't do that, Xueting!

127
00:08:15,300 --> 00:08:16,100
Xueting,

128
00:08:16,439 --> 00:08:17,160
nothing happened

129
00:08:17,160 --> 00:08:18,839
between Yu Changxuan and me.

130
00:08:20,240 --> 00:08:21,139
See for yourself.

131
00:08:43,340 --> 00:08:44,539
What happened?

132
00:08:46,639 --> 00:08:48,100
I tried to kill myself.

133
00:08:50,539 --> 00:08:51,960
That's why he let me go.

134
00:09:03,500 --> 00:09:04,299
I'm sorry.

135
00:09:05,759 --> 00:09:06,899
I'm so sorry.

136
00:09:09,139 --> 00:09:10,759
I couldn't protect you.

137
00:09:12,080 --> 00:09:13,220
It's my fault you

138
00:09:15,159 --> 00:09:16,460
had to go through all this.

139
00:09:24,460 --> 00:09:25,240
Xueting,

140
00:09:27,639 --> 00:09:29,940
it's over now.

141
00:09:32,000 --> 00:09:33,700
Let's put it behind us,

142
00:09:35,600 --> 00:09:36,460
all right?

143
00:09:39,399 --> 00:09:40,200
All right.

144
00:10:50,539 --> 00:10:52,100
Ammo! Where's the ammo?

145
00:10:54,019 --> 00:10:54,820
Hurry!

146
00:11:08,860 --> 00:11:09,799
Follow me! Charge!

147
00:11:10,679 --> 00:11:12,019
Charge!

148
00:11:12,580 --> 00:11:13,759
Charge!

149
00:11:15,320 --> 00:11:18,440
Charge!

150
00:11:34,059 --> 00:11:34,919
General,

151
00:11:35,299 --> 00:11:36,519
Young Master has led his men

152
00:11:36,600 --> 00:11:38,000
across a tributary of the Luan River

153
00:11:38,200 --> 00:11:39,059
and broken through the Qi Army's

154
00:11:39,059 --> 00:11:39,919
first line of defense.

155
00:11:40,059 --> 00:11:41,059
A resounding victory, sir.

156
00:11:41,200 --> 00:11:41,820
Good.

157
00:11:42,620 --> 00:11:43,059
He's also

158
00:11:43,700 --> 00:11:44,679
ordered General Kuang

159
00:11:44,679 --> 00:11:45,600
and Director Gu

160
00:11:46,419 --> 00:11:47,659
to attack the Qi Army

161
00:11:47,659 --> 00:11:48,919
from the north and east.

162
00:11:49,120 --> 00:11:50,000
He and the men will

163
00:11:50,360 --> 00:11:51,720
break through their second line

164
00:11:51,720 --> 00:11:53,120
at Mount Qingluan before the day's out.

165
00:11:53,460 --> 00:11:55,320
Then we'll strike from three sides

166
00:11:55,519 --> 00:11:56,679
and catch the Qi Army

167
00:11:56,679 --> 00:11:57,659
off guard.

168
00:11:58,220 --> 00:11:59,019
Good.

169
00:11:59,059 --> 00:11:59,779
Understood.

170
00:12:01,399 --> 00:12:02,820
There's hope now.

171
00:12:04,500 --> 00:12:05,399
That's such good news!

172
00:12:05,399 --> 00:12:06,220
Wonderful.

173
00:12:08,000 --> 00:12:09,220
We're hiring a proofreader.

174
00:12:09,419 --> 00:12:10,539
A man of your talent

175
00:12:10,539 --> 00:12:11,659
is worth more than that.

176
00:12:12,000 --> 00:12:13,620
Why not write for us instead?

177
00:12:17,419 --> 00:12:18,200
Because

178
00:12:18,720 --> 00:12:19,279
I need

179
00:12:19,279 --> 00:12:20,620
a job that pays daily.

180
00:12:23,600 --> 00:12:24,919
That's Jiang Xueting.

181
00:12:25,220 --> 00:12:26,259
You know, Junguan.

182
00:12:33,019 --> 00:12:34,019
Go on, go.

183
00:12:34,159 --> 00:12:35,059
We're not hiring you.

184
00:12:35,059 --> 00:12:35,659
Wait.

185
00:12:35,720 --> 00:12:36,379
Save it.

186
00:12:36,480 --> 00:12:36,899
Out.

187
00:12:39,220 --> 00:12:39,820
Get out.

188
00:12:40,100 --> 00:12:41,019
You've caused enough trouble.

189
00:12:45,799 --> 00:12:46,799
Please, just go.

190
00:12:47,120 --> 00:12:47,500
We can't

191
00:12:47,500 --> 00:12:48,580
risk hiring someone like you.

192
00:12:48,720 --> 00:12:49,139
Go.

193
00:12:49,779 --> 00:12:50,700
But, sir...

194
00:12:50,779 --> 00:12:51,399
Just leave.

195
00:13:09,320 --> 00:13:10,120
Xueting?

196
00:13:12,179 --> 00:13:12,840
Xueting?

197
00:13:27,860 --> 00:13:28,539
Xueting?

198
00:13:28,799 --> 00:13:29,799
What's going on?

199
00:13:31,159 --> 00:13:31,960
Pingjun?

200
00:13:32,620 --> 00:13:33,320
Don't sit on the floor.

201
00:13:33,360 --> 00:13:33,799
Come on, get up.

202
00:13:33,799 --> 00:13:34,519
Pingjun?

203
00:13:34,620 --> 00:13:35,419
It's cold down there.

204
00:13:35,419 --> 00:13:36,320
You're here.

205
00:13:39,700 --> 00:13:40,759
Careful. Easy now.

206
00:13:45,500 --> 00:13:46,299
Pingjun,

207
00:13:48,000 --> 00:13:49,620
do you know how many times

208
00:13:49,620 --> 00:13:51,399
I was turned down today?

209
00:13:53,019 --> 00:13:54,860
Not a single place

210
00:13:54,899 --> 00:13:56,600
would hire me.

211
00:13:57,559 --> 00:13:59,019
They looked

212
00:13:59,299 --> 00:14:01,220
at me like dirt.

213
00:14:08,059 --> 00:14:08,860
Xueting,

214
00:14:10,000 --> 00:14:11,500
times are hard.

215
00:14:12,059 --> 00:14:13,899
You'll find work. It just takes time.

216
00:14:15,720 --> 00:14:17,440
Take my time?

217
00:14:18,360 --> 00:14:19,360
And find it how?

218
00:14:20,399 --> 00:14:21,200
Oh, right.

219
00:14:22,220 --> 00:14:23,919
Like last time.

220
00:14:25,100 --> 00:14:26,419
Let you sacrifice yourself

221
00:14:30,200 --> 00:14:30,960
for me again?

222
00:14:36,720 --> 00:14:39,000
I'm just a loser

223
00:14:40,279 --> 00:14:43,960
who relies on a woman's

224
00:14:45,100 --> 00:14:46,379
sacrifice

225
00:14:46,379 --> 00:14:48,879
to save his own skin.

226
00:14:49,980 --> 00:14:51,379
I'm useless!

227
00:15:06,960 --> 00:15:07,679
Pingjun,

228
00:15:08,019 --> 00:15:08,740
hand me

229
00:15:08,740 --> 00:15:10,139
that ball of red thread.

230
00:15:12,059 --> 00:15:12,820
Ping?

231
00:15:14,220 --> 00:15:14,879
The ball of red thread.

232
00:15:14,879 --> 00:15:16,360
Pass it to me.

233
00:15:17,820 --> 00:15:18,460
Okay.

234
00:15:28,059 --> 00:15:28,820
Pingjun,

235
00:15:30,679 --> 00:15:32,620
Xueting's hardly been by lately.

236
00:15:32,799 --> 00:15:34,120
Tell me the truth.

237
00:15:34,659 --> 00:15:37,159
What's going on between you two?

238
00:15:43,480 --> 00:15:45,179
It's nothing.

239
00:15:45,360 --> 00:15:47,080
He's been looking for work.

240
00:15:47,360 --> 00:15:48,460
He's just been busy.

241
00:15:51,159 --> 00:15:52,279
Then tell me,

242
00:15:52,820 --> 00:15:54,419
how did things

243
00:15:54,820 --> 00:15:56,659
turn around for Xueting?

244
00:16:00,159 --> 00:16:01,879
It was Young Master Yu, right?

245
00:16:05,940 --> 00:16:07,460
He's the one

246
00:16:08,539 --> 00:16:10,519
who pulled strings for my surgery too,

247
00:16:10,960 --> 00:16:11,720
isn't he?

248
00:16:12,600 --> 00:16:13,139
Doctor,

249
00:16:13,200 --> 00:16:14,000
rest assured.

250
00:16:14,000 --> 00:16:15,399
We'll take extra care.

251
00:16:15,659 --> 00:16:16,720
Young Master Yu asked that she

252
00:16:16,720 --> 00:16:17,580
get the best medicine

253
00:16:17,580 --> 00:16:18,519
and the best nurses.

254
00:16:18,980 --> 00:16:20,519
The order came from Young Master Yu,

255
00:16:20,580 --> 00:16:21,639
so everyone stay sharp.

256
00:16:21,960 --> 00:16:23,320
If anything changes with the patient,

257
00:16:23,320 --> 00:16:24,320
report to me right away.

258
00:16:24,519 --> 00:16:24,940
Got it.

259
00:16:25,720 --> 00:16:27,259
I just want to know

260
00:16:27,919 --> 00:16:30,860
what happened between you and him.

261
00:16:31,360 --> 00:16:32,159
And

262
00:16:32,259 --> 00:16:33,980
where were you all that time

263
00:16:34,519 --> 00:16:35,919
you were away?

264
00:16:45,259 --> 00:16:46,559
I was staying

265
00:16:52,360 --> 00:16:54,000
at Redleaf the whole time.

266
00:17:08,160 --> 00:17:10,380
You foolish girl.

267
00:17:12,759 --> 00:17:14,960
I know you had no choice.

268
00:17:15,700 --> 00:17:17,019
You couldn't stand by

269
00:17:17,019 --> 00:17:18,720
and watch Xueting suffer,

270
00:17:20,059 --> 00:17:21,700
or let anything happen to him.

271
00:17:23,259 --> 00:17:24,779
But, my dear, don't you see

272
00:17:24,779 --> 00:17:26,000
how this

273
00:17:26,319 --> 00:17:27,740
will eat away at him?

274
00:17:27,740 --> 00:17:29,160
He won't be able to

275
00:17:29,220 --> 00:17:31,220
just put it behind him.

276
00:17:31,619 --> 00:17:32,519
But Mom,

277
00:17:33,660 --> 00:17:34,859
Yu Changxuan

278
00:17:34,900 --> 00:17:36,960
didn't touch me.

279
00:17:38,700 --> 00:17:40,220
I believe you.

280
00:17:40,559 --> 00:17:42,599
Of course I do.

281
00:17:47,559 --> 00:17:49,900
But Xueting won't

282
00:17:50,319 --> 00:17:52,400
get over this

283
00:17:52,799 --> 00:17:54,500
overnight.

284
00:18:00,660 --> 00:18:04,400
Give each other some time.

285
00:18:05,619 --> 00:18:08,460
He knows what kind of girl you are.

286
00:18:09,000 --> 00:18:11,500
In time, this

287
00:18:12,299 --> 00:18:13,720
will pass.

288
00:18:16,220 --> 00:18:17,059
[And find it how?]

289
00:18:18,099 --> 00:18:19,740
[Like last time.]

290
00:18:20,319 --> 00:18:21,799
[Let you sacrifice yourself]

291
00:18:22,759 --> 00:18:23,559
[for me again?]

292
00:18:28,700 --> 00:18:30,660
Oh, you silly girl.

293
00:18:38,920 --> 00:18:40,200
- Over here.
- Me too.

294
00:18:40,420 --> 00:18:41,079
Gimme some soup.

295
00:18:41,720 --> 00:18:43,920
- Smells so good!
- Fill it up.

296
00:18:44,500 --> 00:18:45,539
Line up, guys.

297
00:18:45,740 --> 00:18:47,460
No pushing. One at a time.

298
00:18:48,019 --> 00:18:48,819
There's enough for everyone.

299
00:18:54,579 --> 00:18:55,579
Another bowl?

300
00:18:59,519 --> 00:19:01,460
This soup is amazing.

301
00:19:01,460 --> 00:19:02,359
I've never had

302
00:19:02,460 --> 00:19:04,160
mutton soup this rich in my whole life.

303
00:19:04,660 --> 00:19:05,460
Have some more, Guan Bao.

304
00:19:05,500 --> 00:19:06,259
Drink up.

305
00:19:06,259 --> 00:19:06,819
Okay.

306
00:19:08,319 --> 00:19:09,359
Looks like

307
00:19:10,000 --> 00:19:10,759
there's

308
00:19:10,759 --> 00:19:12,359
no stopping the Yu Army!

309
00:19:12,759 --> 00:19:13,420
Guan Bao,

310
00:19:13,559 --> 00:19:14,559
that's three wins

311
00:19:14,559 --> 00:19:15,819
out of three.

312
00:19:15,859 --> 00:19:16,960
Keep this up,

313
00:19:16,960 --> 00:19:17,859
and you'll be seeing

314
00:19:17,859 --> 00:19:19,359
your mom soon enough.

315
00:19:19,660 --> 00:19:20,660
Really, Xuewu?

316
00:19:21,000 --> 00:19:21,500
Look around.

317
00:19:22,000 --> 00:19:24,500
Morale's sky-high.

318
00:19:26,099 --> 00:19:28,099
- Commander!
- Commander!

319
00:19:28,400 --> 00:19:29,319
Sir!

320
00:19:29,500 --> 00:19:34,240
- Commander!
- Evening, sir!

321
00:19:34,359 --> 00:19:35,099
Sit down.

322
00:19:35,119 --> 00:19:36,319
No ranks here today,

323
00:19:36,319 --> 00:19:37,559
just brothers in arms sharing a meal.

324
00:19:37,900 --> 00:19:38,480
Sit.

325
00:19:39,039 --> 00:19:40,160
Thank you, sir!

326
00:19:41,220 --> 00:19:41,960
Sit.

327
00:19:44,460 --> 00:19:45,259
What were you talking about?

328
00:19:46,299 --> 00:19:47,099
Sir,

329
00:19:47,700 --> 00:19:48,799
with morale

330
00:19:49,059 --> 00:19:50,859
this high and the men so determined,

331
00:19:50,960 --> 00:19:53,000
we're bound to win soon.

332
00:19:53,440 --> 00:19:53,720
That's right.

333
00:19:53,720 --> 00:19:54,859
Xuewu just offered

334
00:19:54,920 --> 00:19:56,059
to tell our fortunes with dice.

335
00:19:56,259 --> 00:19:58,059
He's really good at it.

336
00:19:58,599 --> 00:19:59,299
Guys,

337
00:19:59,720 --> 00:20:00,539
how about letting Xuewu

338
00:20:00,539 --> 00:20:01,259
tell our fortunes

339
00:20:01,259 --> 00:20:01,900
with his dice?

340
00:20:01,920 --> 00:20:02,859
Yeah!

341
00:20:02,869 --> 00:20:03,460
Do it!

342
00:20:03,500 --> 00:20:04,259
Come on.

343
00:20:05,119 --> 00:20:05,720
All right, then.

344
00:20:05,720 --> 00:20:06,900
Let's see what the dice say.

345
00:20:12,819 --> 00:20:13,599
A six!

346
00:20:14,259 --> 00:20:15,559
Total victory!

347
00:20:15,759 --> 00:20:17,980
- Great!
- Nice!

348
00:20:19,299 --> 00:20:20,099
Xuewu,

349
00:20:20,660 --> 00:20:22,059
that map of yours is excellent.

350
00:20:22,720 --> 00:20:23,519
Keep it up.

351
00:20:23,960 --> 00:20:24,740
Prove yourself

352
00:20:24,740 --> 00:20:26,099
in the Luan River offensive,

353
00:20:26,559 --> 00:20:28,299
and I'll give you a post on my staff.

354
00:20:29,519 --> 00:20:30,319
Way to go.

355
00:20:30,720 --> 00:20:31,220
I...

356
00:20:31,920 --> 00:20:33,660
Th-thank you, Commander.

357
00:20:33,839 --> 00:20:34,940
I won't let you down.

358
00:20:36,500 --> 00:20:37,299
Dapeng,

359
00:20:38,220 --> 00:20:39,559
you're a crack shot.

360
00:20:39,859 --> 00:20:40,700
You've got real talent.

361
00:20:41,519 --> 00:20:42,660
I hear you like horses.

362
00:20:44,259 --> 00:20:46,400
I'll pick out a good one for you tomorrow.

363
00:20:46,420 --> 00:20:47,319
Really?

364
00:20:47,559 --> 00:20:49,759
That's... That's great!

365
00:20:50,059 --> 00:20:51,119
I'll raise a bowl of soup to you.

366
00:20:51,500 --> 00:20:52,319
Here's to you, sir.

367
00:20:53,099 --> 00:20:54,019
Count me in.

368
00:20:55,019 --> 00:20:55,819
Cheers.

369
00:20:59,460 --> 00:21:00,200
Don't eat that.

370
00:21:04,059 --> 00:21:05,200
What's wrong with this bun?

371
00:21:06,000 --> 00:21:06,819
I'll go and ask.

372
00:21:07,019 --> 00:21:07,819
No, no, wait.

373
00:21:08,059 --> 00:21:08,819
Commander,

374
00:21:10,000 --> 00:21:11,220
don't blame the cooks.

375
00:21:11,960 --> 00:21:13,359
We couldn't bear to see them go to waste,

376
00:21:13,400 --> 00:21:14,519
so we asked for them.

377
00:21:15,019 --> 00:21:15,599
Look,

378
00:21:15,619 --> 00:21:16,960
they're still good.

379
00:21:17,000 --> 00:21:17,759
They taste great,

380
00:21:17,759 --> 00:21:18,420
really.

381
00:21:19,400 --> 00:21:20,660
It's moldy. Don't eat it.

382
00:21:20,759 --> 00:21:21,799
I'll have them bring fresh ones.

383
00:21:22,259 --> 00:21:23,059
Sir,

384
00:21:23,220 --> 00:21:24,660
this is plenty good.

385
00:21:25,000 --> 00:21:25,619
Before you came,

386
00:21:25,619 --> 00:21:26,559
we never dreamed

387
00:21:26,980 --> 00:21:27,839
of steamed buns

388
00:21:27,839 --> 00:21:28,619
this big

389
00:21:29,339 --> 00:21:30,339
or mutton soup.

390
00:21:30,900 --> 00:21:31,619
Under

391
00:21:31,619 --> 00:21:32,900
Zhao Chenghai,

392
00:21:33,319 --> 00:21:35,099
all we got was moldy rice bran.

393
00:21:35,119 --> 00:21:36,559
We even went hungry half the time.

394
00:21:37,559 --> 00:21:38,660
Look how well we eat now,

395
00:21:39,000 --> 00:21:39,579
right?

396
00:21:43,000 --> 00:21:43,799
Commander,

397
00:21:44,220 --> 00:21:45,599
if anyone had told me

398
00:21:45,819 --> 00:21:47,359
someone would punish Zhao Chenghai

399
00:21:47,819 --> 00:21:49,160
and fill our bellies,

400
00:21:49,160 --> 00:21:50,299
I'd never have believed it.

401
00:21:51,200 --> 00:21:51,680
But ever

402
00:21:51,680 --> 00:21:53,299
since you had him shot,

403
00:21:54,160 --> 00:21:55,279
we knew you were

404
00:21:55,519 --> 00:21:56,400
the man to follow.

405
00:22:02,420 --> 00:22:03,460
Dapeng's right.

406
00:22:04,200 --> 00:22:05,859
Life under Zhao

407
00:22:05,920 --> 00:22:07,960
was nothing but misery.

408
00:22:08,519 --> 00:22:09,599
Since you took over,

409
00:22:09,619 --> 00:22:10,960
things have been getting better.

410
00:22:11,119 --> 00:22:12,720
We've finally got something

411
00:22:12,799 --> 00:22:14,259
to look forward to.

412
00:22:14,359 --> 00:22:15,299
Right, guys?

413
00:22:15,420 --> 00:22:17,759
- Right!
- Yeah!

414
00:22:18,259 --> 00:22:19,059
We sure do!

415
00:22:19,440 --> 00:22:19,839
Exactly.

416
00:22:20,220 --> 00:22:20,640
Commander!

417
00:22:20,720 --> 00:22:21,160
Sir,

418
00:22:21,500 --> 00:22:21,700
here.

419
00:22:22,000 --> 00:22:22,819
This piece is clean.

420
00:22:23,759 --> 00:22:25,160
I broke off the moldy bits.

421
00:22:25,400 --> 00:22:26,119
It's still good inside.

422
00:22:26,119 --> 00:22:26,559
Smells fine, too.

423
00:22:26,920 --> 00:22:27,359
Try it.

424
00:22:34,559 --> 00:22:35,200
All right.

425
00:22:37,619 --> 00:22:38,859
I'll never forget this meal.

426
00:22:54,700 --> 00:22:55,819
I promise you,

427
00:22:57,359 --> 00:22:58,460
when the fighting's over,

428
00:22:59,559 --> 00:23:00,859
we'll all go back to Nanhuai

429
00:23:01,099 --> 00:23:02,140
and enjoy a better life.

430
00:23:02,759 --> 00:23:06,700
- Yeah!
- Yeah!

431
00:23:06,740 --> 00:23:09,859
- Thank you, sir!
- Thank you, sir!

432
00:23:24,200 --> 00:23:26,420
Banner rising again in the spring breeze?

433
00:23:28,059 --> 00:23:29,359
Way too highbrow.

434
00:23:29,559 --> 00:23:30,400
Melting snow

435
00:23:30,400 --> 00:23:31,519
and rising energy?

436
00:23:31,559 --> 00:23:32,559
None of this made sense.

437
00:23:34,819 --> 00:23:36,920
We're selling enhancing pills.

438
00:23:37,000 --> 00:23:40,420
Write "Get your manhood back."

439
00:23:40,619 --> 00:23:41,519
That's how it's done.

440
00:23:41,559 --> 00:23:42,319
Rewrite it.

441
00:23:44,420 --> 00:23:46,559
It hints at one of the ingredients.

442
00:23:47,160 --> 00:23:48,079
It sums up exactly

443
00:23:48,079 --> 00:23:49,019
what the pills do.

444
00:23:49,019 --> 00:23:49,599
Besides...

445
00:23:49,619 --> 00:23:50,319
No good.

446
00:23:50,599 --> 00:23:51,359
Rewrite it.

447
00:23:57,619 --> 00:23:58,319
Again.

448
00:23:58,400 --> 00:23:59,180
Again.

449
00:23:59,519 --> 00:24:00,220
I told you,

450
00:24:00,420 --> 00:24:02,119
keep it plain and simple!

451
00:24:02,119 --> 00:24:02,819
Do it over.

452
00:24:50,099 --> 00:24:52,420
Excuse me, are you Jiang Xueting?

453
00:24:53,500 --> 00:24:55,019
And you are?

454
00:24:55,119 --> 00:24:56,220
A pleasure, Mr. Jiang.

455
00:24:56,420 --> 00:24:57,519
I'm He Chenglin.

456
00:24:57,619 --> 00:24:58,559
I came all the way

457
00:24:58,559 --> 00:25:00,460
from Guangzhou to Nanhuai to see you.

458
00:25:04,839 --> 00:25:06,119
Every newspaper has

459
00:25:06,240 --> 00:25:07,640
turned me away.

460
00:25:08,259 --> 00:25:11,200
Who would want my writing now?

461
00:25:12,900 --> 00:25:14,720
The papers here won't take you

462
00:25:14,920 --> 00:25:16,180
because they're cowardly

463
00:25:16,180 --> 00:25:16,920
and ignorant.

464
00:25:17,299 --> 00:25:18,339
Your patriotism

465
00:25:18,539 --> 00:25:20,440
and your courage to expose injustices

466
00:25:20,859 --> 00:25:22,039
are exactly

467
00:25:22,039 --> 00:25:23,220
what we value.

468
00:25:23,559 --> 00:25:25,059
You should keep writing

469
00:25:25,259 --> 00:25:27,000
those powerful articles that wake

470
00:25:27,000 --> 00:25:28,039
people to the truth.

471
00:25:28,259 --> 00:25:29,059
Our paper exists

472
00:25:29,059 --> 00:25:30,660
to spread new ideas

473
00:25:30,759 --> 00:25:32,099
and inspire a new generation.

474
00:25:32,839 --> 00:25:33,599
We want

475
00:25:33,599 --> 00:25:35,140
all the Chinese people still suffering

476
00:25:35,400 --> 00:25:37,279
to know that

477
00:25:37,460 --> 00:25:39,579
the world belongs to them too.

478
00:25:48,119 --> 00:25:51,519
What's the paper called?

479
00:25:52,500 --> 00:25:54,119
We've been

480
00:25:54,200 --> 00:25:56,019
waiting for you to name it.

481
00:25:58,960 --> 00:26:00,019
Then let's call it

482
00:26:01,680 --> 00:26:02,599
The Revival.

483
00:26:08,900 --> 00:26:09,819
Xueting?

484
00:26:26,539 --> 00:26:27,279
Pingjun?

485
00:26:31,559 --> 00:26:32,319
Coming.

486
00:26:33,279 --> 00:26:33,880
Mom.

487
00:26:34,720 --> 00:26:36,519
Xueting's been having a hard time.

488
00:26:36,559 --> 00:26:38,299
He's gotten so thin.

489
00:26:38,599 --> 00:26:39,920
I made him some chicken soup.

490
00:26:40,299 --> 00:26:41,460
Take it over to him.

491
00:26:44,019 --> 00:26:44,859
I'll be off, then.

492
00:26:47,000 --> 00:26:47,920
Don't spill it.

493
00:27:04,460 --> 00:27:05,180
Xueting,

494
00:27:05,900 --> 00:27:07,700
do you know how long

495
00:27:07,940 --> 00:27:09,180
it took me to find you?

496
00:27:09,400 --> 00:27:10,059
Yuko,

497
00:27:10,400 --> 00:27:11,460
back in Japan,

498
00:27:11,819 --> 00:27:12,740
I made myself

499
00:27:12,740 --> 00:27:13,660
clear.

500
00:27:14,160 --> 00:27:15,079
We're over.

501
00:27:16,859 --> 00:27:17,859
I don't believe it.

502
00:27:18,859 --> 00:27:20,500
Because we're not right for each other?

503
00:27:20,500 --> 00:27:21,680
Because the spark is gone?

504
00:27:22,099 --> 00:27:23,599
That's absurd.

505
00:27:24,319 --> 00:27:24,880
Yuko,

506
00:27:25,200 --> 00:27:26,920
you can't force love.

507
00:27:27,420 --> 00:27:29,720
We have no future together.

508
00:27:30,000 --> 00:27:31,420
You promised my father

509
00:27:31,420 --> 00:27:32,859
you'd take care of me.

510
00:27:33,460 --> 00:27:35,359
Then you just break it off

511
00:27:35,759 --> 00:27:37,460
and went back home.

512
00:27:38,859 --> 00:27:40,420
How can you be so heartless?

513
00:27:42,019 --> 00:27:42,960
Oh, Xueting,

514
00:27:43,059 --> 00:27:44,960
why didn't you mention

515
00:27:45,000 --> 00:27:47,460
in your letter you were coming home early?

516
00:27:51,819 --> 00:27:54,599
I wanted it to be a surprise.

517
00:27:56,680 --> 00:27:57,319
Pingjun,

518
00:27:58,500 --> 00:27:59,559
actually, in Japan, I...

519
00:28:02,200 --> 00:28:03,599
What happened there?

520
00:28:06,759 --> 00:28:07,599
Never mind.

521
00:28:15,099 --> 00:28:15,819
Pingjun?

522
00:28:18,859 --> 00:28:19,480
Pingjun?

523
00:28:21,099 --> 00:28:21,759
Pingjun!

524
00:28:22,019 --> 00:28:23,019
Let me explain.

525
00:28:24,920 --> 00:28:25,960
Explain what?

526
00:28:26,660 --> 00:28:27,500
It's not what you think

527
00:28:27,500 --> 00:28:28,359
between us.

528
00:28:28,859 --> 00:28:29,779
Her father

529
00:28:29,920 --> 00:28:31,279
is chief of the Special Higher Police.

530
00:28:31,700 --> 00:28:32,460
His men

531
00:28:32,460 --> 00:28:33,759
beat up Chinese students in public.

532
00:28:34,200 --> 00:28:35,099
I got close to her

533
00:28:35,380 --> 00:28:36,000
to get

534
00:28:36,000 --> 00:28:37,000
their internal files,

535
00:28:37,000 --> 00:28:37,579
so I could get

536
00:28:37,579 --> 00:28:38,500
justice for our people.

537
00:28:38,920 --> 00:28:39,960
Justice?

538
00:28:42,259 --> 00:28:43,059
You used

539
00:28:43,059 --> 00:28:44,400
an innocent girl

540
00:28:44,420 --> 00:28:45,299
and broke her heart

541
00:28:45,299 --> 00:28:46,960
for your so-called justice?

542
00:28:48,400 --> 00:28:49,200
Jiang Xueting,

543
00:28:49,720 --> 00:28:50,960
how can you make that

544
00:28:50,960 --> 00:28:52,859
sound so noble?

545
00:28:53,640 --> 00:28:54,799
P-Pingjun,

546
00:28:54,920 --> 00:28:55,720
I'm sorry.

547
00:28:57,259 --> 00:28:58,059
Pingjun,

548
00:28:58,400 --> 00:28:59,200
I-I wanted to tell you

549
00:28:59,200 --> 00:29:00,000
the minute I got back,

550
00:29:00,000 --> 00:29:00,619
but...

551
00:29:00,619 --> 00:29:01,660
But I was afraid you'd be angry.

552
00:29:01,660 --> 00:29:02,500
I just didn't know how to

553
00:29:02,500 --> 00:29:03,359
bring it up.

554
00:29:03,400 --> 00:29:04,059
So you just

555
00:29:04,059 --> 00:29:05,019
kept it from me?

556
00:29:10,519 --> 00:29:11,759
You have your reasons.

557
00:29:13,099 --> 00:29:14,420
I can't judge

558
00:29:15,019 --> 00:29:16,460
whether what you did was right

559
00:29:16,500 --> 00:29:18,220
for your so-called greater good.

560
00:29:19,099 --> 00:29:20,160
But Jiang Xueting,

561
00:29:20,900 --> 00:29:22,000
you've changed.

562
00:29:23,019 --> 00:29:24,359
You're nothing like

563
00:29:24,359 --> 00:29:25,859
the man I knew before.

564
00:29:27,259 --> 00:29:28,920
I feel like I don't know you anymore.

565
00:29:32,019 --> 00:29:33,799
Pingjun, if...

566
00:29:39,420 --> 00:29:40,259
I'm sorry.

567
00:29:44,859 --> 00:29:46,759
I think we both need some time to cool off.

568
00:30:38,599 --> 00:30:40,119
Finally, she's done.

569
00:30:40,119 --> 00:30:41,099
I was

570
00:30:41,099 --> 00:30:42,920
so nervous for her.

571
00:30:43,299 --> 00:30:44,559
That Lan... Wasn't she

572
00:30:44,559 --> 00:30:45,519
a star just

573
00:30:45,519 --> 00:30:46,500
a month ago?

574
00:30:47,000 --> 00:30:48,960
A few days without practice

575
00:30:49,259 --> 00:30:50,200
and you get rusty.

576
00:30:50,559 --> 00:30:51,559
She's finished.

577
00:30:56,960 --> 00:30:58,099
Look at that face.

578
00:30:58,299 --> 00:30:59,579
You'd make a lemon look sweet.

579
00:30:59,799 --> 00:31:00,720
Peachbud,

580
00:31:00,759 --> 00:31:02,299
I've let it slide more than once.

581
00:31:02,319 --> 00:31:03,859
One more nasty word,

582
00:31:03,900 --> 00:31:04,759
and I'll give you

583
00:31:04,759 --> 00:31:06,259
a couple of good slaps.

584
00:31:08,059 --> 00:31:08,859
Oh, please.

585
00:31:08,859 --> 00:31:09,759
I've got better

586
00:31:09,759 --> 00:31:10,759
things to do.

587
00:31:11,420 --> 00:31:13,220
Look at her.

588
00:31:13,220 --> 00:31:14,720
She's not worth the breath.

589
00:31:14,920 --> 00:31:16,519
My shows sell out

590
00:31:16,660 --> 00:31:17,759
every night.

591
00:31:18,019 --> 00:31:18,960
Hers?

592
00:31:19,519 --> 00:31:21,019
If nobody boos,

593
00:31:21,299 --> 00:31:23,099
it's for old times' sake.

594
00:31:28,500 --> 00:31:29,619
What a piece of work.

595
00:31:48,220 --> 00:31:49,019
Kill!

596
00:31:50,940 --> 00:31:51,640
Kill!

597
00:32:28,400 --> 00:32:30,779
Sir, no surprises so far.

598
00:32:31,220 --> 00:32:31,960
Everything's going

599
00:32:31,960 --> 00:32:33,319
according to your plan.

600
00:32:34,180 --> 00:32:36,400
Then just wait for good news.

601
00:33:06,859 --> 00:33:07,599
Ambush!

602
00:33:07,759 --> 00:33:08,500
Ambush!

603
00:33:15,559 --> 00:33:16,259
Cover each other!

604
00:33:16,380 --> 00:33:17,140
Fall back and keep firing!

605
00:33:18,579 --> 00:33:19,019
Fall back!

606
00:33:19,420 --> 00:33:20,359
First Squad, hold the line!

607
00:33:20,480 --> 00:33:21,839
Go! Second and Third Squads, pull back first!

608
00:33:23,400 --> 00:33:24,200
Hold them off!

609
00:33:24,200 --> 00:33:24,660
Keep up!

610
00:33:24,799 --> 00:33:25,559
Move it!

611
00:33:25,559 --> 00:33:28,720
Come on! Keep moving!

612
00:33:50,859 --> 00:33:51,900
The Qi Army hasn't caught up.

613
00:33:51,920 --> 00:33:52,720
It'll be dark soon.

614
00:33:52,720 --> 00:33:53,519
All right.

615
00:33:53,859 --> 00:33:54,660
We'll rest here.

616
00:33:54,660 --> 00:33:55,500
Keep watch.

617
00:33:55,599 --> 00:33:56,440
Rest here!

618
00:33:56,579 --> 00:33:57,500
Stay alert!

619
00:33:57,700 --> 00:33:58,420
Stay alert!

620
00:34:07,259 --> 00:34:07,700
Come on,

621
00:34:08,219 --> 00:34:08,719
over there.

622
00:34:09,000 --> 00:34:09,260
Stay alert!

623
00:34:09,360 --> 00:34:10,059
Commander.

624
00:34:10,260 --> 00:34:10,559
Go.

625
00:34:11,920 --> 00:34:13,019
This is our current

626
00:34:13,019 --> 00:34:13,960
position.

627
00:34:14,500 --> 00:34:15,639
About 15 kilometers

628
00:34:15,639 --> 00:34:16,800
from the ambush site.

629
00:34:17,159 --> 00:34:18,000
Did we bring the equipment?

630
00:34:18,000 --> 00:34:18,719
We have everything.

631
00:34:18,760 --> 00:34:19,619
Ammo, supplies,

632
00:34:19,619 --> 00:34:20,679
and that new batch

633
00:34:20,679 --> 00:34:21,699
of German-style

634
00:34:21,719 --> 00:34:22,500
submachine guns.

635
00:34:22,519 --> 00:34:23,320
Hand them out.

636
00:34:23,320 --> 00:34:23,960
Yes.

637
00:34:25,019 --> 00:34:25,820
Everyone,

638
00:34:26,199 --> 00:34:26,900
switch weapons!

639
00:34:39,000 --> 00:34:39,800
Something's wrong with this gun!

640
00:34:39,800 --> 00:34:40,559
Mine too.

641
00:34:40,679 --> 00:34:41,500
Same here.

642
00:34:41,500 --> 00:34:42,500
This one's faulty too!

643
00:34:42,579 --> 00:34:43,579
Mine doesn't work either!

644
00:34:45,199 --> 00:34:46,000
Sir,

645
00:34:46,099 --> 00:34:47,000
the guns are faulty.

646
00:34:47,659 --> 00:34:48,099
Let me see.

647
00:34:49,400 --> 00:34:49,960
I've got it.

648
00:34:54,219 --> 00:34:55,239
The firing pin's broken,

649
00:34:56,099 --> 00:34:57,199
and the rifling's worn smooth.

650
00:34:57,559 --> 00:34:59,400
It's junk dressed up as new.

651
00:34:59,639 --> 00:35:00,199
Sir,

652
00:35:00,420 --> 00:35:01,519
ours are no good either.

653
00:35:09,099 --> 00:35:10,340
It's useless!

654
00:35:17,360 --> 00:35:17,920
Wait.

655
00:35:18,599 --> 00:35:19,699
Changxuan planned

656
00:35:19,719 --> 00:35:21,199
every detail of this,

657
00:35:21,420 --> 00:35:22,000
and the route

658
00:35:22,000 --> 00:35:23,380
was top secret.

659
00:35:23,599 --> 00:35:25,280
He only took a handful of men.

660
00:35:25,280 --> 00:35:26,420
How did the Qi Army know

661
00:35:26,460 --> 00:35:27,559
to lie in wait for him?

662
00:35:28,019 --> 00:35:28,880
I should have

663
00:35:28,880 --> 00:35:29,760
gone with him.

664
00:35:31,260 --> 00:35:32,800
It's not time to blame yourself.

665
00:35:33,000 --> 00:35:34,000
We need to

666
00:35:34,099 --> 00:35:35,500
report to General Yu right away

667
00:35:35,519 --> 00:35:36,400
and work out a plan.

668
00:35:36,900 --> 00:35:38,019
If the Qi Army is

669
00:35:38,019 --> 00:35:39,300
using this as a diversion,

670
00:35:39,480 --> 00:35:40,500
we have to

671
00:35:40,500 --> 00:35:41,599
be ready for anything.

672
00:35:43,860 --> 00:35:45,360
Based on their route,

673
00:35:46,000 --> 00:35:47,260
they'll most likely fall back toward

674
00:35:47,900 --> 00:35:48,760
Qingshi Ridge

675
00:35:49,179 --> 00:35:50,199
and Yixiantian.

676
00:35:51,119 --> 00:35:51,900
It's a long way.

677
00:35:52,099 --> 00:35:53,300
We have to move fast.

678
00:35:53,920 --> 00:35:55,500
Nothing can happen to Changxuan.

679
00:35:58,599 --> 00:35:59,199
Sir,

680
00:35:59,320 --> 00:36:00,360
we've swept the area.

681
00:36:00,360 --> 00:36:01,280
No sign of pursuit.

682
00:36:01,400 --> 00:36:02,219
We're safe for now.

683
00:36:13,159 --> 00:36:13,920
Commander,

684
00:36:14,360 --> 00:36:15,400
I've learned

685
00:36:15,719 --> 00:36:16,900
a lot from these last few battles.

686
00:36:17,260 --> 00:36:18,019
Look,

687
00:36:18,699 --> 00:36:20,519
this is Lijian Slope.

688
00:36:20,760 --> 00:36:22,900
There's a gorge to the south,

689
00:36:23,099 --> 00:36:24,320
narrow at the top and wide at the bottom.

690
00:36:24,559 --> 00:36:26,400
Strategists call it Yixiantian.

691
00:36:26,559 --> 00:36:27,699
It's a short route

692
00:36:27,760 --> 00:36:30,699
and easy to defend.

693
00:36:31,019 --> 00:36:31,960
With so few of us,

694
00:36:32,420 --> 00:36:34,559
it's our best way out.

695
00:36:35,519 --> 00:36:36,320
Xuewu,

696
00:36:37,500 --> 00:36:38,699
we don't even have

697
00:36:38,699 --> 00:36:39,599
machine guns.

698
00:36:40,760 --> 00:36:41,900
Don't you have your dice?

699
00:36:42,519 --> 00:36:43,780
Take it out and give it a roll.

700
00:36:43,900 --> 00:36:44,780
See if heaven's

701
00:36:44,780 --> 00:36:45,900
left us a way out.

702
00:36:46,559 --> 00:36:47,559
Go on.

703
00:36:47,820 --> 00:36:49,119
Roll it. Come on!

704
00:36:49,119 --> 00:36:49,599
Fine.

705
00:36:49,599 --> 00:36:51,000
I'll roll the dice.

706
00:36:54,360 --> 00:36:55,300
Watch this.

707
00:37:19,679 --> 00:37:20,880
I've been feeding people hope.

708
00:37:21,900 --> 00:37:22,460
Now

709
00:37:23,900 --> 00:37:25,000
I can't even give myself any.

710
00:37:40,960 --> 00:37:41,760
Commander...

711
00:37:49,000 --> 00:37:50,320
Our plan was leaked,

712
00:37:51,519 --> 00:37:53,320
and the guns were faulty.

713
00:37:54,920 --> 00:37:55,940
This is

714
00:37:56,940 --> 00:37:58,159
all on me.

715
00:38:04,360 --> 00:38:05,099
Commander,

716
00:38:06,019 --> 00:38:07,619
as long as we stick together,

717
00:38:08,019 --> 00:38:09,519
we'll make it back alive.

718
00:38:09,920 --> 00:38:11,019
Xuewu still wants

719
00:38:11,019 --> 00:38:12,260
a place on your staff.

720
00:38:12,460 --> 00:38:14,559
He's counting on that promotion.

721
00:38:14,760 --> 00:38:15,519
Aren't you?

722
00:38:16,460 --> 00:38:17,260
That's right.

723
00:38:17,460 --> 00:38:18,260
Commander,

724
00:38:18,519 --> 00:38:19,599
I'm waiting for you

725
00:38:19,599 --> 00:38:21,260
to announce to the whole army

726
00:38:21,420 --> 00:38:22,760
that Sergeant Sun Xuewu,

727
00:38:22,760 --> 00:38:25,059
a fearless fighter with uncanny foresight,

728
00:38:25,500 --> 00:38:27,320
has been promoted to the 9th Army staff.

729
00:38:32,500 --> 00:38:33,300
Commander,

730
00:38:33,860 --> 00:38:34,519
my father

731
00:38:34,519 --> 00:38:35,760
once escorted the youngest son

732
00:38:36,099 --> 00:38:36,920
of

733
00:38:36,920 --> 00:38:39,019
Magistrate Feng of Huaiyang.

734
00:38:39,360 --> 00:38:40,900
There were over 200 men in the escort.

735
00:38:40,900 --> 00:38:42,820
They traveled for over 300 days

736
00:38:42,960 --> 00:38:44,420
and faced five bandit attacks.

737
00:38:44,659 --> 00:38:46,159
By the time they arrived,

738
00:38:46,460 --> 00:38:47,179
only

739
00:38:47,559 --> 00:38:48,719
four guards were left.

740
00:38:48,900 --> 00:38:50,000
But the boy

741
00:38:50,000 --> 00:38:51,099
was still plump and healthy,

742
00:38:51,099 --> 00:38:52,099
without a scratch on him.

743
00:38:52,500 --> 00:38:53,619
In our line of work,

744
00:38:54,059 --> 00:38:55,960
loyalty and honor are in our blood.

745
00:38:56,360 --> 00:38:57,159
Commander,

746
00:38:57,860 --> 00:38:58,760
I made up my mind

747
00:38:58,760 --> 00:39:00,119
when you gave me

748
00:39:00,360 --> 00:39:01,860
this horse.

749
00:39:02,519 --> 00:39:04,420
The Yu Army still needs cavalry.

750
00:39:04,860 --> 00:39:05,739
How about I

751
00:39:05,739 --> 00:39:07,019
train a company for you?

752
00:39:10,000 --> 00:39:10,800
Deal.

753
00:39:19,800 --> 00:39:20,599
Yuan Huai,

754
00:39:21,659 --> 00:39:22,420
what about you?

755
00:39:22,960 --> 00:39:24,059
What would you like to do?

756
00:39:26,260 --> 00:39:27,659
I just wanna go back to farming.

757
00:39:30,760 --> 00:39:32,159
Then why did you enlist?

758
00:39:36,699 --> 00:39:37,920
The war came,

759
00:39:40,900 --> 00:39:42,219
and the crops all burned.

760
00:39:43,099 --> 00:39:44,500
No field stayed

761
00:39:44,699 --> 00:39:46,559
untouched for three seasons.

762
00:39:51,860 --> 00:39:53,320
Couldn't grow a single stalk of wheat.

763
00:39:56,320 --> 00:39:57,719
When we get back safely,

764
00:39:58,659 --> 00:39:59,579
I'll get you some land

765
00:39:59,579 --> 00:40:00,500
on the outskirts

766
00:40:01,420 --> 00:40:02,219
of Nanhuai.

767
00:40:19,059 --> 00:40:19,860
Guan Bao,

768
00:40:21,420 --> 00:40:22,420
everyone's had a turn.

769
00:40:22,519 --> 00:40:23,320
Now you.

770
00:40:23,739 --> 00:40:24,619
What do you want to do?

771
00:40:26,960 --> 00:40:30,360
I just miss my mother.

772
00:40:31,340 --> 00:40:33,199
I wanna get home and see her soon.

773
00:40:35,900 --> 00:40:36,719
Commander,

774
00:40:37,260 --> 00:40:39,099
this kid can really sing.

775
00:40:39,260 --> 00:40:40,019
Bao,

776
00:40:40,019 --> 00:40:41,219
sing something for the Commander.

777
00:40:43,260 --> 00:40:44,559
You can sing?

778
00:40:45,460 --> 00:40:46,360
Oh, no, I couldn't.

779
00:40:47,500 --> 00:40:48,519
Come on.

780
00:40:48,920 --> 00:40:49,719
Sing.

781
00:40:49,760 --> 00:40:50,460
Yeah.

782
00:40:50,559 --> 00:40:51,300
Go on.

783
00:40:51,300 --> 00:40:52,019
For real?

784
00:40:53,019 --> 00:40:53,820
Well,

785
00:40:54,659 --> 00:40:55,920
Sing for us, and this grenade

786
00:40:57,019 --> 00:40:57,820
is yours.

787
00:40:58,099 --> 00:40:59,119
It could save your life.

788
00:40:59,420 --> 00:40:59,960
Sir,

789
00:41:00,679 --> 00:41:02,659
I wouldn't dare use it.

790
00:41:03,840 --> 00:41:05,800
What if I throw it wrong?

791
00:41:08,300 --> 00:41:09,119
So you're giving it back?

792
00:41:12,900 --> 00:41:14,699
I only know one song.

793
00:41:19,960 --> 00:41:20,900
Here goes, then.

794
00:41:27,059 --> 00:41:33,679
♪Who knows how my mom misses me?♪

795
00:41:35,159 --> 00:41:41,860
♪I long for her in my dreams.♪

796
00:41:43,000 --> 00:41:45,260
♪Mom.♪

797
00:41:45,800 --> 00:41:47,940
♪My dear mom.♪

798
00:41:49,099 --> 00:41:55,980
♪Peach blossoms fall as apricot trees bloom.♪

799
00:42:46,460 --> 00:42:48,059
The world might be cruel,

800
00:42:49,500 --> 00:42:50,619
but you're different.

801
00:42:52,860 --> 00:42:54,199
You hold power,

802
00:42:55,820 --> 00:42:57,820
yet you haven't let it corrupt you.

803
00:42:59,559 --> 00:43:00,360
So

804
00:43:01,099 --> 00:43:02,199
in your eyes,

805
00:43:03,239 --> 00:43:04,239
I'm a good man?

806
00:43:06,059 --> 00:43:07,760
You guard this land.

807
00:43:08,900 --> 00:43:10,159
So I'll pray

808
00:43:10,800 --> 00:43:11,619
the Yu Army

809
00:43:12,559 --> 00:43:13,719
brings its people

810
00:43:13,719 --> 00:43:14,900
real peace.

811
00:43:15,360 --> 00:43:17,239
That matters more than whether I

812
00:43:17,900 --> 00:43:19,099
think you're a good man.

813
00:43:22,000 --> 00:43:22,940
I'll take

814
00:43:24,199 --> 00:43:25,219
that to heart.

815
00:44:11,699 --> 00:44:13,280
We're under attack!

816
00:44:13,420 --> 00:44:14,059
Enemy attack!

817
00:44:14,059 --> 00:44:15,000
Take cover!

818
00:44:15,679 --> 00:44:17,059
Move! Move!

819
00:44:17,639 --> 00:44:18,420
Take cover!

820
00:44:19,579 --> 00:44:20,280
Enemy fire!

821
00:44:27,420 --> 00:44:28,079
Look out!

822
00:44:32,000 --> 00:44:32,639
Commander!

823
00:44:33,800 --> 00:44:34,400
Commander,

824
00:44:34,739 --> 00:44:35,619
I'm nobody.

825
00:44:35,619 --> 00:44:36,500
Why risk your life for me?

826
00:44:40,659 --> 00:44:41,460
Hang on!

827
00:44:42,659 --> 00:44:43,260
Fall back!

828
00:44:43,460 --> 00:44:44,699
Head for Yixiantian.

829
00:44:45,039 --> 00:44:45,679
Yes, sir.

830
00:44:51,460 --> 00:44:52,260
Hold the line.

831
00:44:53,159 --> 00:44:54,420
Hold on!

832
00:45:06,019 --> 00:45:07,619
Any cavalryman still breathing, with me!

833
00:45:07,619 --> 00:45:08,599
Grab every grenade!

834
00:45:08,760 --> 00:45:09,739
Let's clear a way out for the Commander

835
00:45:09,739 --> 00:45:10,719
and our men!

836
00:45:10,860 --> 00:45:11,760
He Dapeng, what are you doing?

837
00:45:11,820 --> 00:45:12,320
Get back here!

838
00:45:12,360 --> 00:45:13,059
He Dapeng!

839
00:45:13,199 --> 00:45:13,519
Dapeng!

840
00:45:13,679 --> 00:45:15,739
- Commander.
- Commander.

841
00:45:16,619 --> 00:45:18,420
I'll train your cavalry in the next life.

842
00:45:18,860 --> 00:45:19,619
Come back!

843
00:45:24,199 --> 00:45:25,000
Dapeng!

844
00:45:27,960 --> 00:45:28,920
He Dapeng!

845
00:45:32,059 --> 00:45:33,599
He Dapeng!

846
00:45:34,059 --> 00:45:34,860
Get back!

847
00:45:35,219 --> 00:45:36,340
That's an order!

848
00:45:36,340 --> 00:45:37,219
Dapeng, don't.

849
00:45:37,239 --> 00:45:38,579
He Dapeng!

850
00:45:39,340 --> 00:45:45,260
- Charge!
- Charge!
